## 7. WORKFLOW INTEGRATION SECTION (NEW)

**Purpose:** Explain that Syrix has a dedicated Workflow module from XCorp for building complex business automation flows, not just single MCP actions.

**Title:** `t('workflow.title')` → "Workflow Automation"

**Key Message:**
- Instead of calling individual MCP actions, build complete business workflows
- Visual workflow builder (like Activepieces)
- 700+ app integrations
- Direct connection to Help Desk Agent

**Content:**
```tsx
{t('workflow.desc')}
```

**Illustration:**
- Workflow builder canvas
- Drag-and-drop nodes
- Example flow: Lead → Validate → Calculate → Book → Notify
- ActivePieces-style design

**CTA:**
```tsx
{t('workflow.cta')}
```

