|--------|-----|-----|-------|
| **Pillars** | Tabs | 4 cards | 4 illustrated cards |
| **Deploy** | Not shown | Not shown | Dedicated section with illustration |
| **Running Agent** | Not shown | Not shown | Full chat mockup |
| **Workflow** | Basic CTA | Highlighted | Full section with ActivePieces-style builder |
| **App Examples** | None | 6 categories | 6 specific apps shown |
| **Visuals** | Text only | Some illustrations | Rich diagrams for all steps |

